126
00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:25.120
Oh, my God.

127
00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.340
Oh, oh, my God.

128
00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:28.140
Oh, God.

129
00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:30.320
I don't know what to say right now.

130
00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:30.640
I'm so.

131
00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:31.860
You are kidding.

132
00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:34.620
And he came up and he was like bowing.

133
00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:35.660
He's like, The Rocker.

134
00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:36.960
The Rocker.

135
00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:38.700
I have seen it like 12.

136
00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:39.620
Oh, my God.

137
00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:39.980
The Rock.

138
00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:40.380
You were.

139
00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.180
Oh, my God.

140
00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:41.760
That movie.

141
00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:42.420
Oh.

142
00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:43.740
And he just was.

143
00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:44.700
It was incredible.

144
00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:46.160
And I was like, Mr. Gandolfini.

145
00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:49.200
I was just such a huge Sopranos fan.

146
00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:50.720
I loved all of his stuff.

147
00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:55.900
So that was pretty cool because, you know, seven people saw that movie when it came out.

148
00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:57.940
