That is something you'll hold forever.

151
00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:02.740
Yeah, it really was.

152
00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:05.820
That was that was a very special minute and a half of my life.

153
00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:10.160
Now, Rain, you're saying you're not sure that Dwight should have been manager, but we

154
00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.720
did get a taste of Dwight as manager and Dwight K.

155
